; ---- EGG-2: the finished record ---------------------------------------------------------------
; Talon's easter-egg addendum §5 -- keep the boringness and turn it into the effect, "stillness
; and wrongness, not jump-scares". Directed 2026-09-02 by /direct at ABSENCE altitude; the call,
; the gates and the five constitutive constraints are in THRILL-BIBLE.md §12 under
; "the cyan run: the room where you were measured", and the device is the new §10 row
; "The finished record".
;
; The direction in one line: this section was authored as a MEASURING INSTRUMENT rather than as a
; place, and that -- not under-dressing -- is why it reads flat. So nothing here makes it a nicer
; place. What is added makes the flatness read as DELIBERATE: a second ruler on a bearing that is
; nobody's, and a run's worth of skid marks that no run of yours produced, ending where nothing
; stands. The apparatus is not broken, not abandoned and not haunted. It is FINISHED.
;
; The five constraints, and how the nodes below satisfy each:
;   (a) NOTHING MOVES and nothing responds to arrival -- every node added is a static mesh or a
;       StaticBody. No script, no Area3D, no animation, no trigger anywhere in this block.
;   (b) THE RECORD NEVER NAMES ITS SUBJECT -- marks and rulers only. No footprint, no silhouette,
;       no name, no tally. The moment it says WHOSE, it is lore and it lands nowhere (§8.1).
;   (c) THE APPARATUS STAYS FULLY USABLE -- SprintLane, its strips, its gear and skid marks and
;       the Slalom are untouched. The dissonance is that the ruler still measures you AND is
;       already finished; a broken ruler is just a ruin.
;   (d) NOTHING FIRES OR GATES -- a player who crosses without looking gets a flat run and loses
;       nothing. That is what keeps it out of §8.4 and what makes noticing it worth anything.
;   (e) IT MAY NOT ATTEND TO THE PLAYER -- the gallery is square to the LANE, never to wherever a
;       player happens to be. EGG-2 also puts the Watcher in this level; furniture that follows
;       you is a second creature and collides with §10's "The watched".
;
; NOT DONE, and ruled out in the brief itself: densely foresting this with the underused tree
; assets. It would have made the plate a different kind of fun place, which is the one thing the
; direction forbids.
;
; NOT DONE, and refused by the register rather than by taste: a cool colour grade. §6.6 is already
; `spent-here` in this level on the lake, whose own material header calls itself "the ONE surface
; in the level graded away from the toy palette". Cyan's palette is untouched; the wrongness is
; carried by arrangement and completeness instead.
